  "text": "You've learned the cantrips sprites have used since time immemorial. You gain Figment and Light as primal innate cantrips. If you have the kirakor sprite heritage, you also gain Detect Magic and can use figment to create sounds or visions. If you have the draxie sprite heritage, you also gain Prestidigitation. A cantrip is heightened to a spell rank equal to half your level rounded up.",
